<span class="meta">National-Level INSPIRE Award · Innovation Concept Developer</span>
<h3>Smart Railway Animal Detection &amp; Warning System</h3>
<p>A sensor-based early-warning concept for safer wildlife and railway crossings, designed to reduce collisions, particularly involving elephants. Animal corridors guide wildlife to designated crossing zones, where sensors detect movement and warn approaching trains.</p>
<ul class="chips"><li>Pressure sensor plates</li><li>Microcontroller</li><li>Signal amplifier</li><li>Red/green warning signals</li><li>Solar power</li></ul>
<div class="diagram"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 150" role="img" aria-label="Diagram of an elephant corridor, sensor plate, microcontroller and railway signal"><g fill="none" stroke="#30343B" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="M10 120h380M10 132h380"/><path d="M40 132v8M80 132v8M120 132v8M160 132v8M200 132v8M240 132v8M280 132v8M320 132v8M360 132v8" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="60" y="88" width="90" height="22" rx="5" fill="#F2C9B8"/><rect x="195" y="52" width="46" height="34" rx="6" fill="#CADCEB"/><path d="M150 99h45M241 69h50"/><path d="M330 120V40"/><circle cx="330" cy="32" r="10" fill="#D8D0EA"/><circle cx="330" cy="56" r="10" fill="#78856C"/><path d="M262 22l6-10 6 10 10 3-10 3-6 10-6-10-10-3z" fill="#F2C9B8"/></g><g font-family="Manrope,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#30343B"><text x="62" y="82">Sensor plate</text><text x="190" y="46">MCU + amplifier</text><text x="296" y="148">Red / green signal</text><text x="236" y="16">Solar</text></g></svg></div>
</div>
<div>
